# Analysis notebooks only (workbook IDs 21 onward); installed into .venv-notebook by
# `make notebook-setup`. Not part of the Airflow runtime or test images.
# Libraries shared with the pipeline are pinned to the versions in requirements.txt so the
# notebooks compute with the same pandas/pyarrow/numpy/scikit-learn/joblib as the scripts.
# (A `-c requirements.txt` constraint cannot be used: that lock targets Python 3.10 only.)
